{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"DHI-imz6-6avs-7ox7-nh33","published":"2026-11-13T00:27:04Z","modified":"2026-11-28T04:45:14.109651575Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-59244"],"summary":"Apache Airflow's secrets masker did not mask `var.json` Variable values whose value is a dict in the Rendered Templates…","details":"Apache Airflow's secrets masker did not mask `var.json` Variable values whose value is a dict in the Rendered Templates UI — the dict value failed an `isinstance(str)` guard — so a secret stored as a JSON Variable and referenced in a template via `var.json` was displayed in cleartext to any user with access to that task's Rendered Templates view. Users are advised to upgrade to apache-airflow 3.3.1 or later, which masks nested Variable values regardless of type.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"airflow","ecosystem":"Docker Hardened Images:Debian:13","purl":"pkg:deb/dhi/airflow"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3.3.1-0"}]}],"versions":["3.3.0-0","3.3.0-1","3.3.0-2","3.3.0-3"],"database_specific":{"owner_kind":"HSP","source":"https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/advisories/blob/main/dhi/osv/2026/DHI-imz6-6avs-7ox7-nh33.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://scout.docker.com/v/DHI-imz6-6avs-7ox7-nh33"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-59244"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://lists.apache.org/thread/fncod6vttfo5fvmfs3h9r8s2kmm9j1n6"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/08/12/7"},{"type":"FIX","url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/pull/68975"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-f643-3rc2-j27w"},{"type":"FIX","url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/commit/b23955afc5c74386a092a1be5bcd376751c3c8a9"},{"type":"FIX","url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/commit/aee182636d0b10a95d94400f7d8b3228dc2c802f"},{"type":"FIX","url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/commit/917a086be848943aaaaa577b927e381f2dc1e99f"},{"t